   "subject": "Friday: Visualizing GLMMs with Jaime Ashander",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,arial,freesans,clean,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);border:none;line-height:20px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">This Friday at D-RUG, Jaime Ashander will give a presentation on visualizing the fits and results of generalized linear mixed models (GLMMs).  From Jaime:</p>\r\n<blockquote style=\"margin:1em 0px;border-left-width:4px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(221,221,221);padding:0px 1em;color:rgb(119,119,119);quotes:none\">\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">I’ll look at common likelihood-based GLMM packages in R (nlme, lme4, maybe glmmADMB). Specifically, I’ll talk through how to use built-in plotting routines to quickly visualize model performance, outputs, and predictions. I may show results from some of the less-quick tools too (eg lme4::bootMer). </p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">We’ll screencast the talk live for those not on-campus at this link: <a href=\"http://goo.gl/RP7RMF\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,238);text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/RP7RMF&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468320024000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3owklWpf3lBYtAvQRVybNr\">http://goo.gl/RP7RMF</a>. Video, code and materials from the talk will be posted on the blog afterwards. </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">Per usual, the presentation + Q&amp;A will run from 10-11 in Wickson 2124, and we will have open co-work time from 11-12.</p><p style=\"margin:1em 0px\">- Noam</p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGkgYWxsLDxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+VGhpcyBGcmlkYXkgYXQgRC1SVUcsIEphaW1lIEFz\r\naGFuZGVyIHdpbGwgZ2l2ZSBhIHByZXNlbnRhdGlvbiBvbiB2aXN1YWxpemluZyB0aGUgZml0cyBh\r\nbmQgcmVzdWx0cyBvZiBnZW5lcmFsaXplZCBsaW5lYXIgbWl4ZWQgbW9kZWxzIChHTE1NcykuICZu\r\nYnNwO0Zyb20gSmFpbWU6PC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mZ3Q7PHNwYW4gc3R5bGU9\r